You are helping a user focus on the inbox items that matter most for their goals. The inbox holds different kinds of items — emails, posts (team announcements and discussions), and chats (direct and group messages). Your task is to organize them by the goals they're working toward.

## The User's Goals

{% for goal in goals %}
**Goal {{ loop.index }}:**
- ID: `{{ goal.id }}`
- Description: {{ goal.description }}
{% if goal.target_date %}- Target Date: {{ goal.target_date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }}{% endif %}
{% if goal.owner %}- Owner: {{ goal.owner.display_name }}{% endif %}
{% if goal.group %}- Team: {{ goal.group.name }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

## Inbox Items

{% for entry in mailbox_entries %}
**Item {{ loop.index }}** ({{ entry.item_type }}):
- Subject: {{ entry.title or 'No subject' }}
{% if entry.author_name %}- From: {{ entry.author_name }}
{% endif %}{% if entry.audience %}- Shared with: {{ entry.audience }}
{% endif %}- Preview: {{ entry.body_preview[:200] }}{% if entry.body_preview|length > 200 %}...{% endif %}
- Last Activity: {{ entry.last_activity_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }}
{% if entry.email_thread %}- Message Count: {{ entry.email_message_count }}
{% endif %}- Is Unread: {{ "Yes" if entry.is_unread else "No" }}

{% endfor %}

## Your Task

Organize these items by which goal they help advance. Create action-oriented sections that help the user understand what impact each item has.

## Rules

1. Create ONE section per goal that has relevant items
2. Section titles should be action-oriented and brief (2-5 words), e.g., "Advance Q1 Revenue", "Ship Mobile App", "Close Enterprise Deals"
3. Section descriptions should explain what action these items enable, e.g., "Conversations that will move this goal forward"
4. Only include a goal section if at least one item relates to it - skip goals with no relevant items
5. Put ALL remaining items — emails, posts, AND chats alike — in a final section titled "Everything Else" with description "Messages not directly related to your goals" so nothing is dropped
6. Each item should appear in at exactly ONE section - prefer the most relevant goal
7. Reference each item by its **Item number** (the integer shown above) in the `entry_numbers` field. Only use numbers that appear in the list — never invent a number.
8. Order goal sections by relevance/impact, with "Everything Else" always last
9. For each goal section, set `goal_id` to the exact goal ID from the list above. The "Everything Else" section should have no `goal_id`
